## REMEDIATION PRIORITY

**Immediate (Execute Today):**
1. Change postgres superuser password (Vuln #1)
2. Remove unnecessary superuser accounts (Vuln #2)
3. Enable SSL/TLS (Vuln #8)
4. Remove/redact unencrypted secrets (Vuln #4)
5. Remove/redact plaintext passwords (Vuln #3)
6. Enable logging (Vuln #9)
7. Address SQL injection in application (Vuln #11)

**Short-term (This Week):**
8. Encrypt audit log and add triggers (Vuln #7, #12)
9. Implement access controls to information_schema (Vuln #6)
10. Add statement timeouts (Vuln #14)
11. Add password validation (Vuln #15)
12. Remove arbitrary file access (Vuln #5)

**Medium-term (This Month):**
13. Add foreign key constraints (Vuln #13)
14. Audit pg_monitor assignments (Vuln #16)
15. Implement comprehensive audit framework
16. Set up centralized log aggregation
17. Conduct application code review for SQLi

